### Solution Components

**1. HAL Response Structure**

Standard HAL format for all hypermedia responses:

```json
{
  "_links": {
    "self": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-2026-000123",
      "title": "Claim CLM-2026-000123"
    },
    "collection": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims",
      "title": "All Claims"
    },
    "member": {
      "href": "/api/v1/members/AZ-1234567-01",
      "title": "Member Details"
    },
    "provider": {
      "href": "/api/v1/providers/1234567890",
      "title": "Provider Details"
    },
    "status": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-2026-000123/status",
      "title": "Check Claim Status"
    },
    "cancel": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-2026-000123/cancel",
      "title": "Cancel Claim",
      "type": "application/json",
      "method": "POST"
    },
    "add-attachment": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-2026-000123/attachments",
      "title": "Upload Supporting Documentation",
      "type": "multipart/form-data",
      "method": "POST"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "href": "https://developer.gainwell.com/claims/lifecycle",
      "title": "Claims Lifecycle Documentation",
      "type": "text/html"
    }
  },
  "claimId": "CLM-2026-000123",
  "status": "Submitted",
  "submittedDate": "2026-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "providerId": "1234567890",
  "memberId": "AZ-1234567-01",
  "serviceDate": "2026-01-10",
  "totalAmount": 450.00,
  "diagnosisCodes": ["E11.9", "I10"],
  "procedureCodes": [{"code": "99213", "amount": 150.00}]
}
```

**Link Properties**:
- `href`: Required - URL to related resource or action
- `title`: Optional - Human-readable link description
- `type`: Optional - Expected media type for the target
- `method`: Optional - HTTP method (defaults to GET)
- `deprecation`: Optional - URL to deprecation notice if link being phased out
- `profile`: Optional - URL to additional semantics
- `hreflang`: Optional - Language of target resource

**2. State-Based Link Generation**

Links vary based on resource state:

**Claim in "Draft" Status**:
```json
{
  "_links": {
    "self": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123"},
    "submit": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/submit", "method": "POST"},
    "edit": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123", "method": "PUT"},
    "delete": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123", "method": "DELETE"}
  },
  "claimId": "CLM-123",
  "status": "Draft"
}
```

**Claim in "Submitted" Status** (different available actions):
```json
{
  "_links": {
    "self": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123"},
    "status": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/status"},
    "cancel": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/cancel", "method": "POST"},
    "add-attachment": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/attachments", "method": "POST"}
  },
  "claimId": "CLM-123",
  "status": "Submitted"
}
```

**Claim in "Paid" Status** (past-action links):
```json
{
  "_links": {
    "self": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123"},
    "remittance-advice": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/era"},
    "submit-correction": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123/corrections", "method": "POST"},
    "view-payment": {"href": "/api/v1/payments/PAY-789"}
  },
  "claimId": "CLM-123",
  "status": "Paid",
  "paidDate": "2026-01-20T14:00:00Z",
  "paidAmount": 425.00
}
```

**3. Link Builder Component**

Server-side component generating contextual links:

```csharp
// C# Link Builder Example
public class ClaimLinkBuilder : ILinkBuilder<Claim>
{
    private readonly IUrlHelper _urlHelper;
    private readonly IAuthorizationService _authz;
    private readonly IStateTransitionService _stateTransitions;

    public Links BuildLinks(Claim claim, ClaimsPrincipal user)
    {
        var links = new Links();

        // Always include self link
        links.Add("self", new Link
        {
            Href = _urlHelper.Link("GetClaim", new { id = claim.ClaimId }),
            Title = $"Claim {claim.ClaimId}"
        });

        // Collection link
        links.Add("collection", new Link
        {
            Href = _urlHelper.Link("GetClaims", null),
            Title = "All Claims"
        });

        // Related resources
        links.Add("member", new Link
        {
            Href = _urlHelper.Link("GetMember", new { id = claim.MemberId }),
            Title = "Member Details"
        });

        links.Add("provider", new Link
        {
            Href = _urlHelper.Link("GetProvider", new { id = claim.ProviderId }),
            Title = "Provider Details"
        });

        // State-based action links
        var availableTransitions = _stateTransitions.GetAvailableTransitions(claim.Status);

        foreach (var transition in availableTransitions)
        {
            // Check authorization for this action
            if (await _authz.AuthorizeAsync(user, claim, transition.RequiredPolicy))
            {
                links.Add(transition.RelationType, new Link
                {
                    Href = _urlHelper.Link(transition.RouteName, new { id = claim.ClaimId }),
                    Title = transition.Description,
                    Method = transition.HttpMethod
                });
            }
        }

        // Conditional links based on business rules
        if (claim.Status == ClaimStatus.Submitted &&
            DateTime.UtcNow < claim.SubmittedDate.AddHours(24))
        {
            links.Add("cancel", new Link
            {
                Href = _urlHelper.Link("CancelClaim", new { id = claim.ClaimId }),
                Title = "Cancel Claim (available for 24 hours after submission)",
                Method = "POST"
            });
        }

        if (claim.RequiresAttachments)
        {
            links.Add("add-attachment", new Link
            {
                Href = _urlHelper.Link("AddClaimAttachment", new { id = claim.ClaimId }),
                Title = "Upload Supporting Documentation",
                Method = "POST",
                Type = "multipart/form-data"
            });
        }

        // Documentation links
        links.Add("documentation", new Link
        {
            Href = $"https://developer.gainwell.com/claims/{claim.Status.ToLower()}",
            Title = $"Documentation for {claim.Status} claims",
            Type = "text/html"
        });

        return links;
    }
}
```

**4. Relation Type Registry**

Centralized registry of standard link relation types:

```json
{
  "relationTypes": {
    "self": {
      "description": "Canonical URI of the current resource",
      "standard": "IANA Web Linking",
      "usage": "Required on all responses"
    },
    "collection": {
      "description": "Link to the collection containing this resource",
      "standard": "IANA Web Linking",
      "usage": "Recommended for singleton resources"
    },
    "submit": {
      "description": "Submit a draft resource for processing",
      "standard": "Gainwell Custom",
      "method": "POST",
      "usage": "Available when resource in draft/editable state"
    },
    "cancel": {
      "description": "Cancel a submitted resource",
      "standard": "Gainwell Custom",
      "method": "POST",
      "usage": "Available based on business rules (e.g., within 24 hours)"
    },
    "add-attachment": {
      "description": "Upload supporting documentation for a resource",
      "standard": "Gainwell Custom",
      "method": "POST",
      "mediaType": "multipart/form-data"
    },
    "remittance-advice": {
      "description": "Electronic remittance advice for a paid claim",
      "standard": "Gainwell Custom",
      "method": "GET",
      "mediaType": "application/pdf"
    }
  }
}
```

**5. Embedded Resources**

HAL supports embedding related resources to reduce roundtrips:

```json
{
  "_links": {
    "self": {"href": "/api/v1/claims/CLM-123"}
  },
  "_embedded": {
    "member": {
      "_links": {
        "self": {"href": "/api/v1/members/AZ-1234567-01"}
      },
      "memberId": "AZ-1234567-01",
      "firstName": "John",
      "lastName": "Doe",
      "dateOfBirth": "1985-03-15"
    },
    "provider": {
      "_links": {
        "self": {"href": "/api/v1/providers/1234567890"}
      },
      "providerId": "1234567890",
      "name": "Family Medicine Clinic",
      "npi": "1234567890"
    }
  },
  "claimId": "CLM-123",
  "status": "Submitted"
}
```

**Benefits**: Reduces HTTP roundtrips by including commonly accessed related resources.
**Trade-off**: Larger payloads vs. fewer requests.

